# Train Of Thought Problem: Optimization Algorithm for GANs and Transformers

**Authors:** Alex Nguhi

## Abstract
<p>The strengths but also the deterioration of any generative AI systemcan be modeled as a train of thought problem whereby we can do optimization basing on a performance indicator over time.</p>

